family: F4
grade: deterministic

--- prompt ---
In packages/bench_fixture/Classes/Controller/BenchModuleController.php, add a private
helper method formatTitle(string $title): string that trims the input and upper-cases
its first character. Use it for the heading rendered by overviewAction.

--- oracle ---
echo "expect: private formatTitle(string): string added and called from overviewAction; file still parses"

--- check ---
F=packages/bench_fixture/Classes/Controller/BenchModuleController.php
grep -qE 'private function formatTitle\(string \$title\): string' "$F" || exit 1
grep -qE 'formatTitle\(' "$F" || exit 1
# Called, not merely defined.
test "$(grep -c 'formatTitle' "$F")" -ge 2 || exit 1
ddev exec php -l "/var/www/html/$F" >/dev/null 2>&1
